# Local-only / sensitive content
# These directories hold per-session working notes, plans, and drafts that may
# contain client ticket details, internal URLs, reporter names, or screenshots.
# Review carefully before un-ignoring or committing anything from here.
handoffs/
reviews/
proposals/
plans/
lessons/
decks/

# Client-specific contracts — keep local, not in the shared repo.
# The shared repo ships only generic example contracts (e.g. contracts/uswds.md)
# and contracts/_template.md. Create your own client contract locally from the template.
contracts/nsf.md

# Personal voice overlay — individual, not shared.
# The repo ships templates/voice/voice.personal.template.md as a starter scaffold.
templates/voice/voice.personal.md

# Secrets / env
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
